   "body": "Correct me if I'm wrong, but as a healer, among aegis spells that share a cooldown with each other, in what case you'd prefer to counter attack your opponent (infused aegis) instead of reducing ALL damage taken by 25% (celestial aegis)? Moreover, testing the spell with a 1H weapon on some mobs outside the capital, it seems to counterattack for 3-5 arcane damage, not preventing the hit reaching you. Either this skill is genuinely weak or bugged altogether.",
